!docs/superpowers/specs/

# astryx CLI scratch
# We commit astryx.config.mjs (the integration-pack registry). The CLI hard-fails
# `astryx doctor` with "Multiple Astryx config files" if a second astryx.config.*
# coexists, so keep the other extensions out of the repo. If you ever migrate to
# .ts, delete this line in the same commit that renames the tracked file.
astryx.config.ts
astryx.config.js
# `astryx init --features agents` scaffolds these for tools this project doesn't
# use; we own AGENTS.md by hand. Re-include a file here if that ever changes.
.claude/CLAUDE.md
.cursorrules
HERMES.md
